## Tests and quality

```bash
cmake -S . -B build -DXMPL100_BUILD_TESTS=ON && cmake --build build && ctest --test-dir build
```

The host tests cover every call and every error it can return, with the firmware's flags (`-fno-exceptions
-fno-rtti`, warnings as errors). CI also checks coverage, complexity, sanitizers, clang-tidy and the handbook rules
(`.kokeb/handbook.yml`). See [Testing and CI](docs/testing.md).

